/* i18n-dict.js - interface strings in every language Frontier offers.

   Keys are the English text exactly as the interface shows it; a key that
   starts with @ belongs to one element marked data-i18n="..." (the tab bar),
   for words that read differently as a tab and as a button ("Stake", "Vote").
   No imports, so tests can load it in node. Legal texts (terms.html) are not
   translated here: they stay in English, the version users accept. */

